msgid " msec"
msgstr " meil"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:344
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being "
"shown."
msgstr "Yma gallwch addasu hyd yr effaith \"cloch weledol\" y dangosir."

